<description>&lt;p&gt;Ansar al-Sunna militants continue to attack civilians in Cabo Delgado, especially around Macomia, limiting humanitarian access. The Mozambican government is advancing a large LNG megaproject concept with a final investment decision nearing, while DP World is expanding its port investment in the country. Youth protests and broader political discontent are rising in response to the security situation and governance concerns. 151 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQT2M2S2ZFMWUxcnFIMnVZbTNpSlBGcVBQbWVGN0NZTDJya1l1LXNIYnFLeG5nc1ptR2psdjQ4TGpQc0pvN3JiZTJmaWV2RzVaN1lqanVtbjhydXRrLWpJbkVCNmh6d1FDZFZKT0UtbVZwai1Sc2U0aGRVM01DOFpmWGQxaVl0SmNCcElxSkNDazQ0a3ZiaEpUeWVJOEE3V1Zz?oc=5&quot;&gt;Foot-Africa.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPZkZrNEZiUDVxZmVhdkVUYUVNRVc4SU5kUFcyenNoRVdhRkpfVDRXb0ZOQVJ1dFJUY2lzUEFKRG5rN1NjZ0c4QnVRcHJHX2NXbFJuTjRDbm1hLWhZcGViSGhTVVQxUWNNUXFLcWtOZ0NOQWhYOGpEeldZdjA0ZUlkMTctVFRtaUNfR1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOYzZLWVVaYnoyLW9zbS00X2VSNFFYdXJVVEc3TDBUVXpfS0UwR2YyLVlMcnFtd0FkME53dURtTlFLakVJWVJ6ajBOaHdrUGNuT2dFWENsLVRWUXdyRVZlV3NGOEt0MUxGQjVuUXhfYjc5a2d0ZnMzbllNZVFmY0NwX1E3RE54M1RFUWNKN3hPMUk1QVIyMUxEekdR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOa2FDRUItUF9WcllBWUhRbks4R1FuLS02TWE5OWgzYms3XzR4WkdiQU11MXA3ajRvRU0zSEJGU0hVbjFaemJPREFvT3c1UGJYVU5aRm1UUktHVkhpbzN3UUJWMEdqc09LUEgyNGd4Q1Nld05OVVlhMzlZZERMZFhsc09oQ3Ftc25iT3JQaVBRVWpGMlRWRDFuXzJhZGd1VExRTTVGbXF3bw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://new